  "relation_to_previous_no_go": "The primitive E7(-2)/Nikulin obstruction remains valid.  These carriers escape it because the H10/45 lattice is a nonprimitive finite-index divisor sublattice of the full Picard lattice and the geometric automorphism has order four.",
